sdlc-factory adapts material from Agent Skills, https://github.com/addyosmani/agent-skills,
used under the MIT License below. The adapted files, each of which names its sources on the line
after its heading:

  agents/spec-writer.md        skills/spec-driven-development
  agents/builder.md            skills/incremental-implementation, skills/test-driven-development,
                               skills/planning-and-task-breakdown
  agents/reviewer-code.md      agents/code-reviewer.md, skills/code-review-and-quality
  agents/reviewer-security.md  agents/security-auditor.md, skills/security-and-hardening
  agents/reviewer-test.md      agents/test-engineer.md

agents/approver.md is written for this plugin. The shape of the loop (a spec-writer, a builder,
parallel reviewers and an approver handing work over through files, in rounds) is the idea behind
zazencodes' "Software Factory for Claude Code". No text of that repository is used: it carries no
license.

